    "description": "Open Mentalism 2.5 - Damage Resistance. Spells for resisting heat and cold, sustaining extra concussion hits, relieving stun, delaying and neutralizing poison, and waking from unnatural sleep. Special Notes: For more on healing, see RMFRP Section 24.1 (p. 75).",
